      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大概问题的后文是，\r\n『那个店主最早在哪个车站的拉面店修行过？』",
      "source_fingerprint": "73271ed611c2af4e36ff69a3232cb4fb7c31a11518c61403e40689ce4959e149",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
