      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f76fc82a69309e5ecf0b4784",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "其实，那位店长曾在『侃侃諤諤【かんかんが\r\nくがく】』与『喧喧囂囂【けんけんごうご\r\nう】』两家店都修行过！",
      "source_fingerprint": "16b356f4287bffcb6a957d4f87d5b027b8f1abbf8e6fa684774564aeaf2895ff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022108.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:052848439d8e27a6328f7568",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "美妙姿势",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1cb551351a68022b5153ce22910be53e5784043168e94eb897bec2ce3a0afb0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022108.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1856259acfc4439afd2ee6dd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但『侃侃諤諤』主要进行的是营业方面的修行，\r\n而拉面的口味还是来源于『喧喧囂囂』！\r\n这种情况下池袋就是正解了吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8431a55a009280efabca53fcfb8a8e166804f44c8126d2cc4a248166216cc9b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022108.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d824ea51293b5f07d1815d22",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "活动主持人",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bd1a60a42183c5fa81814f5365604bcf69ee7cb7f1e22b118503000cd4d188e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022108.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:786d4642e0f83de52242978c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不愧是美妙姿势，回答正确！\r\n这本是一道越热爱拉面便越容易答错的难题，\r\n但她仍然回答正确！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3555cc961b5d935e15d93a28eb43f180d9e275213eb901b0dddf72217b0239fd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022108.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a263ef8fbf9953e8d0e49ce",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "美妙姿势",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1cb551351a68022b5153ce22910be53e5784043168e94eb897bec2ce3a0afb0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022108.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91779b5a72839344483393b2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为店名给了我提示呀！\r\n你看，店名里『喧喧【けんけん】』更靠前嘛♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c15e22ccce904fce9d8e1557e3a86c064b846e608002518b01e658a6b00d3af",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022108.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb4c0a4c39a4995f7ff17faa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "自称拉面通",
      "source_fingerprint": "adba12ea06ccd018a6450986ffb83e940bebce3babd972ed9f46a74a55679fc0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022108.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6af4f789dec10afa8d8e9bb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对拉面的爱，以及深不可测的知识……\r\n美妙姿势，不可小觑。简直是拉面界的黑船……\r\n（注：黑船指近代打开日本国门的黑色战舰）",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f57f1fbe06126cd2a6db3ede5ea05ba4dab4b57dbb31ab0b8c5d8f17040d879",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022108.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be2fa6b7325f402ac319e0e1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就这样，美妙姿势留下完美的结果，\r\n让观众们彻底沸腾起来了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "44b679466cf2d51332e2d1c2912b5a90ff1f59c6cb7c9c71ce737936af92fc8c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022108.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee412cee82ed982e0b2b2b78",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是因为被粉丝们的热情感染了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7a6283134b1d59046b8395216443074431ace926d41b11a9fdbfec8039c78e4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
