    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06adc5d3c378641c02682979",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为赛场上的表现，她的粉丝增加了不少；\r\n而今天更是难以在人群中确保她的安全。\r\n但是——",
      "source_fingerprint": "1df1bb4aa684d2cfa8e36f9590bbdf7275f42fc4a0a62cc79981eecbcec878ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
