        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6056d5ddbe6adf3b00144415",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了让美妙姿势也能享受这次活动，\r\n我找到护卫队长，与她开始面对面谈判。\r\n对美妙姿势而言，这是仅此一次的机会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dfe60bbd4ad60e9916f393290fde2d52e426dcad33f261dcf6705347c45bc21",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022108.json",
      "json_path": [
