      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当这梦境消散之际，我也会从大家心中消失……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1987c387809a981066055e7b9005b9450834a35ef4eb85381f54d527706b748",
